{
  "title": "Nutty Snappy Venezuelan Hummus Bake",
  "description": "A hangover-cure dish featuring a nutty and snappy vegan version of classic hummus topped with a crispy salt-bake. Great for a dairy-free-friendly breakfast.",
  "cuisine": "venezuelan",
  "diet": [
    "vegan",
